  <!-- Headline -->
  <h2>What Actually Makes SimLocal Different</h2>
  <p>
    SimLocal runs a "No Quibble Refunds" policy: cancel and get your money back if you change your mind, no explanation required. That's a genuinely more relaxed return policy than most eSIM sellers on this site offer, where a refund usually depends on the eSIM never having been activated.
  </p>
  <p>
    Support is also worth flagging because it's not what the badge on this page implies. SimLocal doesn't run a website live-chat widget: its 24/7 support channel is <strong>WhatsApp</strong>, plus email and a help centre. If you're the type who wants to message support from your phone mid-trip rather than dig up a laptop, that's actually a better fit than a chat bubble buried on a desktop site.
  </p>

